    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a \"feeling\". it's a logical conclusion. if i stay, i just become a burden and a stranger to everyone who loves me. staying feels more like a slow, cruel joke than actually living. do you think it's actually a mistake to want to leave on my own terms?",
